{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 37,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fret not thyself because of evil-doers,\nNeither be thou envious against them that work unrighteousness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they shall soon be cut down like the grass,\nAnd wither as the green herb.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Trust in Jehovah, and do good;Dwell in the land, and feed on ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " faithfulness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Delight thyself also in Jehovah;\nAnd he will give thee the desires of thy heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Commit thy way unto Jehovah;\nTrust also in him, and he will bring it to pass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he will make thy righteousness to go forth as the light,\nAnd thy justice as the noon-day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rest in Jehovah, and wait patiently for him:\nFret not thyself because of him who prospereth in his way,\nBecause of the man who bringeth wicked devices to pass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cease from anger, and forsake wrath:\nFret not thyself, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " only to evil-doing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For evil-doers shall be cut off;\nBut those that wait for Jehovah, they shall inherit the land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For yet a little while, and the wicked shall not be:\nYea, thou shalt diligently consider his place, and he shall not be.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the meek shall inherit the land,\nAnd shall delight themselves in the abundance of peace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked plotteth against the just,\nAnd gnasheth upon him with his teeth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The Lord will laugh at him;\nFor he seeth that his day is coming.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked have drawn out the sword, and have bent their bow,\nTo cast down the poor and needy,\nTo slay such as are upright in the way.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their sword shall enter into their own heart,\nAnd their bows shall be broken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Better is a little that the righteous hath\nThan the abundance of many wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the arms of the wicked shall be broken;\nBut Jehovah upholdeth the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah knoweth the days of the perfect;\nAnd their inheritance shall be for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall not be put to shame in the time of evil;\nAnd in the days of famine they shall be satisfied.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the wicked shall perish,\nAnd the enemies of Jehovah shall be as the fat of lambs:\nThey shall consume; in smoke shall they consume away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked borroweth, and payeth not again;\nBut the righteous dealeth graciously, and giveth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For such as are blessed of him shall inherit the land;\nAnd they that are cursed of him shall be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man’s goings are established of Jehovah;\nAnd he delighteth in his way.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though he fall, he shall not be utterly cast down;\nFor Jehovah upholdeth him with his hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have been young, and now am old;\nYet have I not seen the righteous forsaken,\nNor his seed begging bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the day long he dealeth graciously, and lendeth;\nAnd his seed is blessed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Depart from evil, and do good;\nAnd dwell for evermore.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Jehovah loveth justice,\nAnd forsaketh not his saints;\nThey are preserved for ever:\nBut the seed of the wicked shall be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous shall inherit the land,\nAnd dwell therein for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The mouth of the righteous talketh of wisdom,\nAnd his tongue speaketh justice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The law of his God is in his heart;\nNone of his steps shall slide.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked watcheth the righteous,\nAnd seeketh to slay him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah will not leave him in his hand,\nNor condemn him when he is judged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wait for Jehovah, and keep his way,\nAnd he will exalt thee to inherit the land:\nWhen the wicked are cut off, thou shalt see it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have seen the wicked in great power,\nAnd spreading himself like a green tree in its native soil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But one passed by, and, lo, he was not:\nYea, I sought him, but he could not be found.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Mark the perfect man, and behold the upright;\nFor there is a ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "happy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " end to the man of peace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for transgressors, they shall be destroyed together:\nThe end of the wicked shall be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the salvation of the righteous is of Jehovah:\nHe is their stronghold in the time of trouble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.37.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah helpeth them, and rescueth them:\nHe rescueth them from the wicked, and saveth them,\nBecause they have taken refuge in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Security of those who trust in Jehovah, and insecurity of the wicked.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Psalm of David.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
